{"uid":"bc39f12a0a177885","name":"test_a_verified_claim_over_an_unlinked_finding_passes_the_ladder","fullName":"tests.test_confirmation_downgrade#test_a_verified_claim_over_an_unlinked_finding_passes_the_ladder","historyId":"9dd019bfed22912f7869184228428ed6","time":{"start":1791935143649,"stop":1791935143705,"duration":56},"description":"The live review path: `_review_contract_ladder` runs strictly BEFORE\n    `_review_verdict`. On a confirmation review, a `{\"verdict\": \"verified\"}`\n    reply beside an unlinked blocking finding is NOT a contradiction --\n    the rule downgrades the finding before the ladder checks it -- so the\n    ladder makes no re-ask, flags nothing unusable, and `_review_verdict`\n    computes `verified` with exactly one `review.finding_downgraded`.","descriptionHtml":"<p>The live review path: <code>_review_contract_ladder</code> runs strictly BEFORE<br />\n<code>_review_verdict</code>. On a confirmation review, a <code>{&quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;verified&quot;}</code><br />\nreply beside an unlinked blocking finding is NOT a contradiction --<br />\nthe rule downgrades the finding before the ladder checks it -- so the<br />\nladder makes no re-ask, flags nothing unusable, and <code>_review_verdict</code><br />\ncomputes <code>verified</code> with exactly one <code>review.finding_downgraded</code>.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791934845957,"stop":1791934845957,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791934845957,"stop":1791934845957,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,